aux_mysql supplies OpenHalo MySQL compatibility objects for PostgreSQL 18.

The extension installs at version 1.1 and supports the OpenHalo upgrade chain
through 1.6.  PG18-only build and regression-test files are kept alongside the
OpenHalo-compatible extension payload.

The MySQL compatibility tree is built through Meson.  The autoconf/Make build
does not recurse into the MySQL compatibility sources; use the Meson build and
tests described by the repository architecture document.
